# Redirects for salvageunion.io.
#
# Copied into `dist/` by Vite's publicDir and read by Workers Static Assets
# (ADR-033). Netlify reads the same format, so both hosts serve these during the
# parallel phase.
#
# One rule, and it is not cosmetic: the build emits `sitemap-index.xml`, while
# every crawler and every human types `sitemap.xml`. A 301 is correct here —
# the canonical name really is the index, and the redirect is permanent.
/sitemap.xml  /sitemap-index.xml  301
